    "body": "fix on issue/4088-preset-rows · PR #4206 · pinned by preset_rows::heidenhain_posts_refuse_a_preset_above_the_machine_preset_table, preset_rows::an_unstated_or_larger_machine_maximum_keeps_the_post_limit, preset_rows::a_malformed_work_offset_max_is_refused_by_name · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR is stacked on #4164. The Picomax file states `controller.work_offset_max: 5`, from the 2008 CD (`PRESET.PR` rows 0..5). Nobody checked the row count at the control. If the shop added rows, raise the key in the machine file.\n",
